OL,3,AKenya minister warns foreigners against
OL,4,A'misusing' visas to trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenya's trade ministry has warned
OL,7,Fforeign nationals that visa-free entry
OL,8,Finto the country does not grant them
OL,9,Fthe right to work, as the government
OL,10,Fvows to shut down unlicensed small
OL,11,Fbusinesses run by foreigners.
OL,13,FPresident William Ruto had set today as
OL,14,Fthe deadline for foreigners operating
OL,15,Fsmall-scale businesses to cease work.
OL,17,FAhead of the move, the Burundian
OL,18,Fembassy in Kenya said it would offer
OL,19,Femergency free travel documents to its
OL,20,Fcitizens willing to go back home, amid
OL,21,Freports of the mistreatment of
OL,22,FBurundians.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
